            "notes": "Forge Code: S779G- I don't put round 1 items into my build code since those aren't major choices. \nI don't know why  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) wouldn't always be the 3 things you buy every round 1. \n\nGo for kills if you can if a character goes out of position, but it's better to stay in the back and not feed....The Creative Spark guide says shoot the tank for $$$ this round...which sounds smart...but I like to go for the backline kills and get a feel for how hard it is to get those kills (who comes to support them etc).\n\nORRRRR\n\nJust feed this round, it's a warmup round and doesn't really matter. Just remember to get [Hunter's Mark](item_6258ca51-d9dc-47b5-8e85-782c05072485) next round and you'll be fiiiine. (JK-ish)",
