            "notes": "The best 2 Items of Freja -  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)  which give you overhealth for every dash & updraft &  [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) Which give you 50 overhealth for updraft\n\nThese will be CORE for survival while you get those kills. As the rounds go on, these will lose effectiveness...but these two items are key to you staying alive and getting kills.\n\nAt this point what you buy depends on round 1 cash - you can add more AP/DMG/Armor depending on the situation. You are still PRIORITIZING  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) and  [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) these two items have the most impact the earlier the round...and they can still save your life late round matches. The rule is: you can't get money when dead. \n\nI am personally a fan of [Aeroweave Cloak](item_cc2fa1e3-0a87-4682-b856-5ca3ee0134f5) - letting me heal up in the air, being a target while regaining health to confound enemies while I have time to line up backline shots.\n\nif you have crazy money you could get [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) instead of [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) OR [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54)\n\nIf you lost round 1 and they have bounty - prioritize [Hunter's Mark](item_6258ca51-d9dc-47b5-8e85-782c05072485): You can pick this item anywhere from rounds 2-6, though of course it has more value earlier. Having vision helps so much for freja + booty",
