            "notes": "Round 3 we finally can shift towards an APish build - IF you want to. [So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) pairs with our  [Lille F\u00e6lde](item_d92c59ae-b2f5-48e5-9f60-66144441eee8) and makes our 'E' + Rightclicks that much more impactful.\n\n\nSell [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) if you've been using it since the nerf means it won't stack with itself and buy something better, like [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) for survivability.\n\nFor your first Epic AP item you have a choice - \n\nThe best all rounder and stat booster is [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) \n\nFor more survivalbility -   [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) - 15% AD + Armor regen (and Armor) with your  [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) makes those thighs thicc\n\nFor Killing easy squishies -  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) will blow them up. This is pretty worthless with a good kiri opposing you however.",
