            "created_at": "2025-09-22T00:21:02.239953+00:00",
            "notes": "**IMPORTANT IF YOU ARE DYING TOO MUCH**:\n-Against Soldier shooting you, or Ashe dynamite (or any other itty bitty damage in bunches) get [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d)\n\nAgainst headshot Ashe, Genji Decap, 1-hit kill blowing up enemies - Get [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c)\n\n\n---\n\n\nIdeally, you'd have 2 purple AP items - ideally [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for money stats and [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) + [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) that you definitely didn't sell last round....If this is true then pat yourself on the back cause you are doing well. \n\nBut we live in the worst timeline and in this economy and everyone knows you're broke! You can buy back [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) if you sold it last round...or if you managed to keep it you can buy a blue/rare item like  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) or [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56).\n\nIf you're against a DVA who isn't letting you bola too often - that likely means your ult will be rather useless unless you can sneak it in well or pop out a baby dva. You may as well prio [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) and just remember not to....**oh did you just ult**? whoops.\n\n\nIf you're one of them billionaire heirs your fat stacks can be spent on [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), [Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d) if you enjoy slowing your enemies, or shield break/armor pen items for those Reins/zars. If ImmOrisa or enemy healing is too good you can take  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) - Keep in mind this doesn't stack with any teammates also carrying [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).\n\n[Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d) has several benefits with this build if you want to pick it up early -> it makes your RMB Bola last longer thus do more damage, and it will confuse a cassidy who has gotten used to rolling during the explosion.",
